<section  class='av_textblock_section av-m65eyyfr-7b027bceb6ba7b4fef7fd10049d82d98 '   itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/CreativeWork" ><div class='avia_textblock av_inherit_color'  itemprop="text" ><p>Welcome to our FAQ section! Here you’ll find answers to the most frequently asked questions about your event at Waldgeflüster Events. From catering and drinks to setup times, you’ll find all the important information you need for perfect planning.</p>
</div></section>
<div  class='flex_column av-5dnp53-dddb693a23d31a4aee5f8e6afba88778 av_one_half  avia-builder-el-5  el_after_av_textblock  el_before_av_one_half  first flex_column_div  column-top-margin'     ><section  class='av_textblock_section av-m6qikahi-99101b1da4cbfb798a1a62030e30b69e '   itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/CreativeWork" ><div class='avia_textblock'  itemprop="text" ><h2>Catering &#038; Drinks</h2>
</div></section>
<div  class='togglecontainer av-m67xc1nq-03080c80773eb22691b6905744252703 av-minimal-toggle  avia-builder-el-7  el_after_av_textblock  avia-builder-el-last  toggle_close_all'  itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/FAQPage" >
<section class='av_toggle_section av-m67xb0yl-553aa95e633de54d9f9ccbbf98168919'  itemscope="itemscope" itemprop="mainEntity" itemtype="https://schema.org/Question" ><div role="tablist" class="single_toggle" data-tags="{Alle} {catering} {partner} {externe-caterer} "  ><p id='toggle-toggle-id-1' data-fake-id='#toggle-id-1' class='toggler  av-title-above '  itemprop="name"  role='tab' tabindex='0' aria-controls='toggle-id-1' data-slide-speed="200" data-title="Do we have to use one of your catering partners?" data-title-open="" data-aria_collapsed="Click to expand: Do we have to use one of your catering partners?" data-aria_expanded="Click to collapse: Do we have to use one of your catering partners?">Do we have to use one of your catering partners?<span class="toggle_icon"><span class="vert_icon"></span><span class="hor_icon"></span></span></p><div id='toggle-id-1' aria-labelledby='toggle-toggle-id-1' role='region' class='toggle_wrap  av-title-above'   itemscope="itemscope" itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer" ><div class='toggle_content invers-color '  itemprop="text" ><p>We work with 8 experienced catering partners covering a range of styles and price points. These partners know our venue inside and out and make sure everything runs smoothly. You can also choose an external caterer, but this incurs a fee of 800 €.</p>
</div></div></div></section>
<section class='av_toggle_section av-m67xb909-1-e81ba16abdc9521a4c524141f052df53'  itemscope="itemscope" itemprop="mainEntity" itemtype="https://schema.org/Question" ><div role="tablist" class="single_toggle" data-tags="{Alle} {catering} {service} {essen} "  ><p id='toggle-toggle-id-2' data-fake-id='#toggle-id-2' class='toggler  av-title-above '  itemprop="name"  role='tab' tabindex='0' aria-controls='toggle-id-2' data-slide-speed="200" data-title="What does the caterer provide?" data-title-open="" data-aria_collapsed="Click to expand: What does the caterer provide?" data-aria_expanded="Click to collapse: What does the caterer provide?">What does the caterer provide?<span class="toggle_icon"><span class="vert_icon"></span><span class="hor_icon"></span></span></p><div id='toggle-id-2' aria-labelledby='toggle-toggle-id-2' role='region' class='toggle_wrap  av-title-above'   itemscope="itemscope" itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer" ><div class='toggle_content invers-color '  itemprop="text" ><p>Our catering partners take care of everything to do with the food, including equipment, tableware, service staff, and clearing up. All you have to do is enjoy.</p>
</div></div></div></section>
<section class='av_toggle_section av-m67xb909-1-3-bc9edbd7cb5bca980e027bb51f50d85a'  itemscope="itemscope" itemprop="mainEntity" itemtype="https://schema.org/Question" ><div role="tablist" class="single_toggle" data-tags="{Alle} {getränke} {pauschale} {stunden} "  ><p id='toggle-toggle-id-3' data-fake-id='#toggle-id-3' class='toggler  av-title-above '  itemprop="name"  role='tab' tabindex='0' aria-controls='toggle-id-3' data-slide-speed="200" data-title="Can the caterer also be booked for beverage service?" data-title-open="" data-aria_collapsed="Click to expand: Can the caterer also be booked for beverage service?" data-aria_expanded="Click to collapse: Can the caterer also be booked for beverage service?">Can the caterer also be booked for beverage service?<span class="toggle_icon"><span class="vert_icon"></span><span class="hor_icon"></span></span></p><div id='toggle-id-3' aria-labelledby='toggle-toggle-id-3' role='region' class='toggle_wrap  av-title-above'   itemscope="itemscope" itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer" ><div class='toggle_content invers-color '  itemprop="text" ><p class="p1">Beverage service is provided exclusively by us and cannot be handled by third parties or on your own. When booking the venue, one of our packages must be selected: Schluckspecht or Schnapsdrossel.</p>
</div></div></div></section>
<section class='av_toggle_section av-m67xb909-1-3-22-82a05bf153ed08d1ac3d471e0900caf9'  itemscope="itemscope" itemprop="mainEntity" itemtype="https://schema.org/Question" ><div role="tablist" class="single_toggle" data-tags="{Alle} {getränke} {pauschale} {stunden} "  ><p id='toggle-toggle-id-4' data-fake-id='#toggle-id-4' class='toggler  av-title-above '  itemprop="name"  role='tab' tabindex='0' aria-controls='toggle-id-4' data-slide-speed="200" data-title="Would food truck catering / a midnight snack / dessert be possible?" data-title-open="" data-aria_collapsed="Click to expand: Would food truck catering / a midnight snack / dessert be possible?" data-aria_expanded="Click to collapse: Would food truck catering / a midnight snack / dessert be possible?">Would food truck catering / a midnight snack / dessert be possible?<span class="toggle_icon"><span class="vert_icon"></span><span class="hor_icon"></span></span></p><div id='toggle-id-4' aria-labelledby='toggle-toggle-id-4' role='region' class='toggle_wrap  av-title-above'   itemscope="itemscope" itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer" ><div class='toggle_content invers-color '  itemprop="text" ><p class="p1">Yes, both our terrace and the lower grounds in front of the marquee can be accessed directly by vehicle – even with large vehicles.</p>
</div></div></div></section>
<section class='av_toggle_section av-m67xb909-1-3-21-1e4ed5acebdc9b0078c91dc48e0b9b8d'  itemscope="itemscope" itemprop="mainEntity" itemtype="https://schema.org/Question" ><div role="tablist" class="single_toggle" data-tags="{Alle} {getränke} {pauschale} {stunden} "  ><p id='toggle-toggle-id-5' data-fake-id='#toggle-id-5' class='toggler  av-title-above '  itemprop="name"  role='tab' tabindex='0' aria-controls='toggle-id-5' data-slide-speed="200" data-title="How does catering work in bad weather?" data-title-open="" data-aria_collapsed="Click to expand: How does catering work in bad weather?" data-aria_expanded="Click to collapse: How does catering work in bad weather?">How does catering work in bad weather?<span class="toggle_icon"><span class="vert_icon"></span><span class="hor_icon"></span></span></p><div id='toggle-id-5' aria-labelledby='toggle-toggle-id-5' role='region' class='toggle_wrap  av-title-above'   itemscope="itemscope" itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer" ><div class='toggle_content invers-color '  itemprop="text" ><p class="p1">All of our spaces can be reached from one another while staying dry. The passage from the marquee to the annex/main house is covered. This ensures everything runs smoothly even when it rains.</p>
</div></div></div></section>
<section class='av_toggle_section av-m67xb909-fe4ff9da5761051729ce438ceb7556ea'  itemscope="itemscope" itemprop="mainEntity" itemtype="https://schema.org/Question" ><div role="tablist" class="single_toggle" data-tags="{Alle} {getränke} {pauschale} {schluckspecht} {schnapsdrossel} "  ><p id='toggle-toggle-id-6' data-fake-id='#toggle-id-6' class='toggler  av-title-above '  itemprop="name"  role='tab' tabindex='0' aria-controls='toggle-id-6' data-slide-speed="200" data-title="Can we bring our own drinks?" data-title-open="" data-aria_collapsed="Click to expand: Can we bring our own drinks?" data-aria_expanded="Click to collapse: Can we bring our own drinks?">Can we bring our own drinks?<span class="toggle_icon"><span class="vert_icon"></span><span class="hor_icon"></span></span></p><div id='toggle-id-6' aria-labelledby='toggle-toggle-id-6' role='region' class='toggle_wrap  av-title-above'   itemscope="itemscope" itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer" ><div class='toggle_content invers-color '  itemprop="text" ><p>Beverage service is handled exclusively by us. You can choose between our packages “Schluckspecht” and “Schnapsdrossel”, which include alcoholic and non-alcoholic drinks. Children under 12 drink for free.</p>
</div></div></div></section>
<section class='av_toggle_section av-m67xb909-1-3-20-bd9e8cd06ca8e8daf834dfd14014be97'  itemscope="itemscope" itemprop="mainEntity" itemtype="https://schema.org/Question" ><div role="tablist" class="single_toggle" data-tags="{Alle} {getränke} {pauschale} {stunden} "  ><p id='toggle-toggle-id-7' data-fake-id='#toggle-id-7' class='toggler  av-title-above '  itemprop="name"  role='tab' tabindex='0' aria-controls='toggle-id-7' data-slide-speed="200" data-title="How long is the drinks package valid?" data-title-open="" data-aria_collapsed="Click to expand: How long is the drinks package valid?" data-aria_expanded="Click to collapse: How long is the drinks package valid?">How long is the drinks package valid?<span class="toggle_icon"><span class="vert_icon"></span><span class="hor_icon"></span></span></p><div id='toggle-id-7' aria-labelledby='toggle-toggle-id-7' role='region' class='toggle_wrap  av-title-above'   itemscope="itemscope" itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer" ><div class='toggle_content invers-color '  itemprop="text" ><p data-pm-slice="1 1 &#091;&#093;">The drinks package is valid for the entire duration of your event. In the mood for a long drink in the afternoon? No problem!</p>
</div></div></div></section>
<section class='av_toggle_section av-m67xb909-1-3-19-a0743c6ae2b3baefe8adb30f7b2966e9'  itemscope="itemscope" itemprop="mainEntity" itemtype="https://schema.org/Question" ><div role="tablist" class="single_toggle" data-tags="{Alle} {getränke} {pauschale} {stunden} "  ><p id='toggle-toggle-id-8' data-fake-id='#toggle-id-8' class='toggler  av-title-above '  itemprop="name"  role='tab' tabindex='0' aria-controls='toggle-id-8' data-slide-speed="200" data-title="May we bring special drinks ourselves?" data-title-open="" data-aria_collapsed="Click to expand: May we bring special drinks ourselves?" data-aria_expanded="Click to collapse: May we bring special drinks ourselves?">May we bring special drinks ourselves?<span class="toggle_icon"><span class="vert_icon"></span><span class="hor_icon"></span></span></p><div id='toggle-id-8' aria-labelledby='toggle-toggle-id-8' role='region' class='toggle_wrap  av-title-above'   itemscope="itemscope" itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer" ><div class='toggle_content invers-color '  itemprop="text" ><p class="p1">As long as the drinks match the package you’ve booked, that’s no problem. This means, for example, that no spirits may be brought along if you’ve booked the Schluckspecht package. If you have the Schnapsdrossel package, you’re welcome to bring whatever you like – with no restrictions. However, the per-person price of the packages does not change if you bring your own drinks.</p>
</div></div></div></section>
</div></div><div  class='flex_column av-4h4sd3-42c3cce5bd686b6e9eacc69d9cd80372 av_one_half  avia-builder-el-8  el_after_av_one_half  el_before_av_one_half  flex_column_div  column-top-margin'     ><section  class='av_textblock_section av-4aovlj-365e14a28d1f50a0e4982c38671587a9 '   itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/CreativeWork" ><div class='avia_textblock'  itemprop="text" ><h2>Schedule &#038; Organization</h2>
</div></section>
<div  class='togglecontainer av-7gzw13-59ebb008d0c5636cd2387e5556b9e319 av-minimal-toggle  avia-builder-el-10  el_after_av_textblock  avia-builder-el-last  toggle_close_all' >
<section class='av_toggle_section av-48pxl3-af9ad2acc9d3a5a94a05cec793975e92'  itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/CreativeWork" ><div role="tablist" class="single_toggle" data-tags="{Alle} {lautstärke} {sperrstunde} {musik} "  ><p id='toggle-toggle-id-9' data-fake-id='#toggle-id-9' class='toggler  av-title-above '  itemprop="headline"  role='tab' tabindex='0' aria-controls='toggle-id-9' data-slide-speed="200" data-title="Is there a curfew or a volume limit?" data-title-open="" data-aria_collapsed="Click to expand: Is there a curfew or a volume limit?" data-aria_expanded="Click to collapse: Is there a curfew or a volume limit?">Is there a curfew or a volume limit?<span class="toggle_icon"><span class="vert_icon"></span><span class="hor_icon"></span></span></p><div id='toggle-id-9' aria-labelledby='toggle-toggle-id-9' role='region' class='toggle_wrap  av-title-above'  ><div class='toggle_content invers-color '  itemprop="text" ><p>No – night owls that you are, you can celebrate as long as you like. So that our staff can become night owls for you too, a tiered late-night fee applies. The volume indoors/on the dance floor is not limited (though it should stay within a reasonable range) and can definitely be turned up loud enough. In the outdoor areas/marquee, only background music is allowed after 10:00 p.m. – by then most guests are celebrating on the dance floor anyway.</p>
</div></div></div></section>
<section class='av_toggle_section av-28q747-49caee5fb85dbf564e25a58c27b6a090'  itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/CreativeWork" ><div role="tablist" class="single_toggle" data-tags="{Alle} {wetter} {regen} {alternative} "  ><p id='toggle-toggle-id-10' data-fake-id='#toggle-id-10' class='toggler  av-title-above '  itemprop="headline"  role='tab' tabindex='0' aria-controls='toggle-id-10' data-slide-speed="200" data-title="Is a civil marriage ceremony possible on site at Waldgeflüster?" data-title-open="" data-aria_collapsed="Click to expand: Is a civil marriage ceremony possible on site at Waldgeflüster?" data-aria_expanded="Click to collapse: Is a civil marriage ceremony possible on site at Waldgeflüster?">Is a civil marriage ceremony possible on site at Waldgeflüster?<span class="toggle_icon"><span class="vert_icon"></span><span class="hor_icon"></span></span></p><div id='toggle-id-10' aria-labelledby='toggle-toggle-id-10' role='region' class='toggle_wrap  av-title-above'  ><div class='toggle_content invers-color '  itemprop="text" ><p class="p1">A civil marriage ceremony at Waldgeflüster is not possible. Waldgeflüster is not certified as an official civil ceremony venue of the municipality of Hülben. We kindly ask you to refrain from inquiring with the municipality of Hülben, as their current staffing situation is very strained.</p>
</div></div></div></section>
<section class='av_toggle_section av-28q747-18-6bbeaa5be0069d18dab3c6084124156a'  itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/CreativeWork" ><div role="tablist" class="single_toggle" data-tags="{Alle} {wetter} {regen} {alternative} "  ><p id='toggle-toggle-id-11' data-fake-id='#toggle-id-11' class='toggler  av-title-above '  itemprop="headline"  role='tab' tabindex='0' aria-controls='toggle-id-11' data-slide-speed="200" data-title="What happens in bad weather?" data-title-open="" data-aria_collapsed="Click to expand: What happens in bad weather?" data-aria_expanded="Click to collapse: What happens in bad weather?">What happens in bad weather?<span class="toggle_icon"><span class="vert_icon"></span><span class="hor_icon"></span></span></p><div id='toggle-id-11' aria-labelledby='toggle-toggle-id-11' role='region' class='toggle_wrap  av-title-above'  ><div class='toggle_content invers-color '  itemprop="text" ><p>If the weather doesn’t cooperate, your ceremony will take place in the romantically lit marquee – with rain pattering on the roof, twinkling string lights, and lovingly set tables. Either way, we’ll find the perfect spot for your wedding arch and decorations.</p>
<p>For the champagne reception, there are also plenty of sheltered spots available, so you and your guests can enjoy the moment – whatever the weather.</p>
</div></div></div></section>
<section class='av_toggle_section av-28q747-17-30af7bef1bcc06d207d48ef48572dbb6'  itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/CreativeWork" ><div role="tablist" class="single_toggle" data-tags="{Alle} {wetter} {regen} {alternative} "  ><p id='toggle-toggle-id-12' data-fake-id='#toggle-id-12' class='toggler  av-title-above '  itemprop="headline"  role='tab' tabindex='0' aria-controls='toggle-id-12' data-slide-speed="200" data-title="Where will the champagne reception take place?" data-title-open="" data-aria_collapsed="Click to expand: Where will the champagne reception take place?" data-aria_expanded="Click to collapse: Where will the champagne reception take place?">Where will the champagne reception take place?<span class="toggle_icon"><span class="vert_icon"></span><span class="hor_icon"></span></span></p><div id='toggle-id-12' aria-labelledby='toggle-toggle-id-12' role='region' class='toggle_wrap  av-title-above'  ><div class='toggle_content invers-color '  itemprop="text" ><p class="p1">If you’ve booked Package 3, the choice is entirely yours. Arguably our most beautiful option is the champagne reception at our outdoor bar. If the weather is bad, we set up the champagne reception in the passage between the annex and the marquee. That way your guests have plenty of options to take shelter in the main house, the marquee, and under the parasols.</p>
</div></div></div></section>
<section class='av_toggle_section av-5rg3if-048ce9cc725f978023b761f861e286aa'  itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/CreativeWork" ><div role="tablist" class="single_toggle" data-tags="{Alle} {aufbau} {planung} {zeiten} "  ><p id='toggle-toggle-id-13' data-fake-id='#toggle-id-13' class='toggler  av-title-above '  itemprop="headline"  role='tab' tabindex='0' aria-controls='toggle-id-13' data-slide-speed="200" data-title="Where can the first dance take place?" data-title-open="" data-aria_collapsed="Click to expand: Where can the first dance take place?" data-aria_expanded="Click to collapse: Where can the first dance take place?">Where can the first dance take place?<span class="toggle_icon"><span class="vert_icon"></span><span class="hor_icon"></span></span></p><div id='toggle-id-13' aria-labelledby='toggle-toggle-id-13' role='region' class='toggle_wrap  av-title-above'  ><div class='toggle_content invers-color '  itemprop="text" ><p class="p1">In our experience, there is plenty of room on the dance floor for you and your guests. The advantage here is that the party can start right away. Alternatively, you can have your first dance outside under the open sky – the party then continues inside on the dance floor.</p>
</div></div></div></section>
<section class='av_toggle_section av-28q747-16-ea2f1bdcd57a537aecd8ca44eec93683'  itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/CreativeWork" ><div role="tablist" class="single_toggle" data-tags="{Alle} {wetter} {regen} {alternative} "  ><p id='toggle-toggle-id-14' data-fake-id='#toggle-id-14' class='toggler  av-title-above '  itemprop="headline"  role='tab' tabindex='0' aria-controls='toggle-id-14' data-slide-speed="200" data-title="Can your marquee be heated in cold temperatures?" data-title-open="" data-aria_collapsed="Click to expand: Can your marquee be heated in cold temperatures?" data-aria_expanded="Click to collapse: Can your marquee be heated in cold temperatures?">Can your marquee be heated in cold temperatures?<span class="toggle_icon"><span class="vert_icon"></span><span class="hor_icon"></span></span></p><div id='toggle-id-14' aria-labelledby='toggle-toggle-id-14' role='region' class='toggle_wrap  av-title-above'  ><div class='toggle_content invers-color '  itemprop="text" ><p class="p1">Yes, we ensure comfortable temperatures with powerful, silent radiant heaters.</p>
</div></div></div></section>
<section class='av_toggle_section av-5rg3if-15-f1a223f7372ca25619e5615d9b550867'  itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/CreativeWork" ><div role="tablist" class="single_toggle" data-tags="{Alle} {aufbau} {planung} {zeiten} "  ><p id='toggle-toggle-id-15' data-fake-id='#toggle-id-15' class='toggler  av-title-above '  itemprop="headline"  role='tab' tabindex='0' aria-controls='toggle-id-15' data-slide-speed="200" data-title="Where can our guests park?" data-title-open="" data-aria_collapsed="Click to expand: Where can our guests park?" data-aria_expanded="Click to collapse: Where can our guests park?">Where can our guests park?<span class="toggle_icon"><span class="vert_icon"></span><span class="hor_icon"></span></span></p><div id='toggle-id-15' aria-labelledby='toggle-toggle-id-15' role='region' class='toggle_wrap  av-title-above'  ><div class='toggle_content invers-color '  itemprop="text" ><p class="p1">There is plenty of parking available on site. The best place to park is next to the RV park. From there, it’s only about 150 m along a paved footpath to Waldgeflüster. Of course, guests with limited mobility can also be driven up to the back (for drop-off and pick-up only). Parking the wedding car right in front of the venue is no problem.</p>
</div></div></div></section>
<section class='av_toggle_section av-5rg3if-14-f211a2d2acb4ce724f177722de0793ff'  itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/CreativeWork" ><div role="tablist" class="single_toggle" data-tags="{Alle} {aufbau} {planung} {zeiten} "  ><p id='toggle-toggle-id-16' data-fake-id='#toggle-id-16' class='toggler  av-title-above '  itemprop="headline"  role='tab' tabindex='0' aria-controls='toggle-id-16' data-slide-speed="200" data-title="When can we start setting up?" data-title-open="" data-aria_collapsed="Click to expand: When can we start setting up?" data-aria_expanded="Click to collapse: When can we start setting up?">When can we start setting up?<span class="toggle_icon"><span class="vert_icon"></span><span class="hor_icon"></span></span></p><div id='toggle-id-16' aria-labelledby='toggle-toggle-id-16' role='region' class='toggle_wrap  av-title-above'  ><div class='toggle_content invers-color '  itemprop="text" ><p data-pm-slice="1 1 &#091;&#093;">Setup depends on whether there is an event on the day before yours. If no event is taking place, you can start on the afternoon or evening of the previous day. If there is an event on the previous day, setup starts at around 11:00 a.m. on the day of your event.</p>
</div></div></div></section>
<section class='av_toggle_section av-5rg3if-13-ac08edeb46233180d15f0dc0665d6189'  itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/CreativeWork" ><div role="tablist" class="single_toggle" data-tags="{Alle} {aufbau} {planung} {zeiten} "  ><p id='toggle-toggle-id-17' data-fake-id='#toggle-id-17' class='toggler  av-title-above '  itemprop="headline"  role='tab' tabindex='0' aria-controls='toggle-id-17' data-slide-speed="200" data-title="By when do our decorations need to be taken down?" data-title-open="" data-aria_collapsed="Click to expand: By when do our decorations need to be taken down?" data-aria_expanded="Click to collapse: By when do our decorations need to be taken down?">By when do our decorations need to be taken down?<span class="toggle_icon"><span class="vert_icon"></span><span class="hor_icon"></span></span></p><div id='toggle-id-17' aria-labelledby='toggle-toggle-id-17' role='region' class='toggle_wrap  av-title-above'  ><div class='toggle_content invers-color '  itemprop="text" ><p class="p1">As with setup, this depends on the day of the week / our event schedule. As a rule, please plan to have takedown completed by 10:30 a.m. at the latest (it’s important to us that the next party has enough time for their decorations and can set up in peace). Please be fair, stick to this “deadline,” and allow a little extra time for takedown. If no event is taking place here the following day, we’re a bit more flexible – we’ll discuss that with you individually.</p>
</div></div></div></section>
</div></div></p>
<div  class='flex_column av-gyk22f-e0db4dab03f827c0326fb34057af0bdf av_one_half  avia-builder-el-11  el_after_av_one_half  el_before_av_one_half  first flex_column_div  column-top-margin'     ><section  class='av_textblock_section av-m6qil896-b62360047c7e540d1de2fedfd04845b9 '   itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/CreativeWork" ><div class='avia_textblock'  itemprop="text" ><h2>Special Requests</h2>
</div></section>
<div  class='togglecontainer av-ej5eqv-d9a624bad4c28803fe1fe08a7c50ea5d av-minimal-toggle  avia-builder-el-13  el_after_av_textblock  el_before_av_textblock  toggle_close_all' >
<section class='av_toggle_section av-d7zvmv-71c505b9560e40789a0e9807600f5829'  itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/CreativeWork" ><div role="tablist" class="single_toggle" data-tags="{Alle} {wunderkerzen} {feuerwerke} {sicherheit} "  ><p id='toggle-toggle-id-18' data-fake-id='#toggle-id-18' class='toggler  av-title-above '  itemprop="headline"  role='tab' tabindex='0' aria-controls='toggle-id-18' data-slide-speed="200" data-title="Are sparklers, torches, or fireworks allowed?" data-title-open="" data-aria_collapsed="Click to expand: Are sparklers, torches, or fireworks allowed?" data-aria_expanded="Click to collapse: Are sparklers, torches, or fireworks allowed?">Are sparklers, torches, or fireworks allowed?<span class="toggle_icon"><span class="vert_icon"></span><span class="hor_icon"></span></span></p><div id='toggle-id-18' aria-labelledby='toggle-toggle-id-18' role='region' class='toggle_wrap  av-title-above'  ><div class='toggle_content invers-color '  itemprop="text" ><p><strong>Sparklers:</strong> Allowed outdoors.<br />
<strong>Torches:</strong> By arrangement.<br />
<strong>Fireworks:</strong> Strictly prohibited due to our forest location.</p>
</div></div></div></section>
<section class='av_toggle_section av-b581rr-32959f5dc8b861c11a2b29f0d73bb5f1'  itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/CreativeWork" ><div role="tablist" class="single_toggle" data-tags="{Alle} {konfetti} {dekoration} {natur} "  ><p id='toggle-toggle-id-19' data-fake-id='#toggle-id-19' class='toggler  av-title-above '  itemprop="headline"  role='tab' tabindex='0' aria-controls='toggle-id-19' data-slide-speed="200" data-title="May we use confetti?" data-title-open="" data-aria_collapsed="Click to expand: May we use confetti?" data-aria_expanded="Click to collapse: May we use confetti?">May we use confetti?<span class="toggle_icon"><span class="vert_icon"></span><span class="hor_icon"></span></span></p><div id='toggle-id-19' aria-labelledby='toggle-toggle-id-19' role='region' class='toggle_wrap  av-title-above'  ><div class='toggle_content invers-color '  itemprop="text" ><p data-pm-slice="1 1 &#091;&#093;">Conventional confetti is not allowed, as it is hard to remove and harms the environment and the forest. We recommend “natural confetti” made from dried flower petals.</p>
</div></div></div></section>
<section class='av_toggle_section av-b581rr-5-12ff6fc674d0574f405e14bfc1b01f39'  itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/CreativeWork" ><div role="tablist" class="single_toggle" data-tags="{Alle} {konfetti} {dekoration} {natur} "  ><p id='toggle-toggle-id-20' data-fake-id='#toggle-id-20' class='toggler  av-title-above '  itemprop="headline"  role='tab' tabindex='0' aria-controls='toggle-id-20' data-slide-speed="200" data-title="May we release balloons (with wish notes)?" data-title-open="" data-aria_collapsed="Click to expand: May we release balloons (with wish notes)?" data-aria_expanded="Click to collapse: May we release balloons (with wish notes)?">May we release balloons (with wish notes)?<span class="toggle_icon"><span class="vert_icon"></span><span class="hor_icon"></span></span></p><div id='toggle-id-20' aria-labelledby='toggle-toggle-id-20' role='region' class='toggle_wrap  av-title-above'  ><div class='toggle_content invers-color '  itemprop="text" ><p class="p1">Unfortunately, that’s not possible. Our wedding venue is located in the middle of the forest. Most of the balloons would get caught in the trees, and we absolutely want to avoid this kind of pollution – thank you for understanding.</p>
</div></div></div></section>
<section class='av_toggle_section av-b581rr-4-80e0c2ba6793b3875b7546f7642fbefe'  itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/CreativeWork" ><div role="tablist" class="single_toggle" data-tags="{Alle} {konfetti} {dekoration} {natur} "  ><p id='toggle-toggle-id-21' data-fake-id='#toggle-id-21' class='toggler  av-title-above '  itemprop="headline"  role='tab' tabindex='0' aria-controls='toggle-id-21' data-slide-speed="200" data-title="Can chairs be set up just for the ceremony?" data-title-open="" data-aria_collapsed="Click to expand: Can chairs be set up just for the ceremony?" data-aria_expanded="Click to collapse: Can chairs be set up just for the ceremony?">Can chairs be set up just for the ceremony?<span class="toggle_icon"><span class="vert_icon"></span><span class="hor_icon"></span></span></p><div id='toggle-id-21' aria-labelledby='toggle-toggle-id-21' role='region' class='toggle_wrap  av-title-above'  ><div class='toggle_content invers-color '  itemprop="text" ><p class="p1">Unfortunately, this is not possible, as we don’t have enough chairs for the marquee and the open-air wedding ceremony at the same time. Even for smaller parties, we cannot offer this service, as the handling and time involved are too great.</p>
</div></div></div></section>
</div>
<section  class='av_textblock_section av-m6qim3ay-ebf52f63d6426d62d60d426648414b24 '   itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/CreativeWork" ><div class='avia_textblock'  itemprop="text" ><h2>Planning &#038; Contact</h2>
</div></section>
<div  class='togglecontainer av-6jioon-7f27c8c1ff1671fe5295a67f04ed204f av-minimal-toggle  avia-builder-el-15  el_after_av_textblock  avia-builder-el-last  toggle_close_all' >
<section class='av_toggle_section av-38za53-c593e72c8a657614443b6d0b7139ff6d'  itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/CreativeWork" ><div role="tablist" class="single_toggle" data-tags="{Alle} {besichtigung} {location} {termin} "  ><p id='toggle-toggle-id-22' data-fake-id='#toggle-id-22' class='toggler  av-title-above '  itemprop="headline"  role='tab' tabindex='0' aria-controls='toggle-id-22' data-slide-speed="200" data-title="Is a tour of the venue possible?" data-title-open="" data-aria_collapsed="Click to expand: Is a tour of the venue possible?" data-aria_expanded="Click to collapse: Is a tour of the venue possible?">Is a tour of the venue possible?<span class="toggle_icon"><span class="vert_icon"></span><span class="hor_icon"></span></span></p><div id='toggle-id-22' aria-labelledby='toggle-toggle-id-22' role='region' class='toggle_wrap  av-title-above'  ><div class='toggle_content invers-color '  itemprop="text" ><p data-pm-slice="1 1 &#091;&#093;">Yes, we offer tours by appointment. Feel free to contact us anytime to find a date that works. We look forward to meeting you!!</p>
</div></div></div></section>
<section class='av_toggle_section av-3qysbr-a243c6d7e8ebf7a033743566a42fed00'  itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/CreativeWork" ><div role="tablist" class="single_toggle" data-tags="{Alle} {buchung} {anzahlung} {termine} "  ><p id='toggle-toggle-id-23' data-fake-id='#toggle-id-23' class='toggler  av-title-above '  itemprop="headline"  role='tab' tabindex='0' aria-controls='toggle-id-23' data-slide-speed="200" data-title="How does the booking process work?" data-title-open="" data-aria_collapsed="Click to expand: How does the booking process work?" data-aria_expanded="Click to collapse: How does the booking process work?">How does the booking process work?<span class="toggle_icon"><span class="vert_icon"></span><span class="hor_icon"></span></span></p><div id='toggle-id-23' aria-labelledby='toggle-toggle-id-23' role='region' class='toggle_wrap  av-title-above'  ><div class='toggle_content invers-color '  itemprop="text" ><p data-pm-slice="1 1 &#091;&#093;">After signing a detailed booking contract, a down payment of 1,000 € is required to make the booking binding. A second down payment is due six months before the event.</p>
</div></div></div></section>
<section class='av_toggle_section av-38za53-3-6b0a73825a91027402d38eb401c91e9d'  itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/CreativeWork" ><div role="tablist" class="single_toggle" data-tags="{Alle} {besichtigung} {location} {termin} "  ><p id='toggle-toggle-id-24' data-fake-id='#toggle-id-24' class='toggler  av-title-above '  itemprop="headline"  role='tab' tabindex='0' aria-controls='toggle-id-24' data-slide-speed="200" data-title="When should flowers and the cake be delivered?" data-title-open="" data-aria_collapsed="Click to expand: When should flowers and the cake be delivered?" data-aria_expanded="Click to collapse: When should flowers and the cake be delivered?">When should flowers and the cake be delivered?<span class="toggle_icon"><span class="vert_icon"></span><span class="hor_icon"></span></span></p><div id='toggle-id-24' aria-labelledby='toggle-toggle-id-24' role='region' class='toggle_wrap  av-title-above'  ><div class='toggle_content invers-color '  itemprop="text" ><p class="p1">Please always plan for flowers and the cake to be delivered on the day of the event itself. That way they stay fresh, and nothing will clash in case decoration setup is only possible on the event day.</p>
</div></div></div></section>
<section class='av_toggle_section av-38za53-2-688fd46a91e76898a292cefd49bcdf35'  itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/CreativeWork" ><div role="tablist" class="single_toggle" data-tags="{Alle} {besichtigung} {location} {termin} "  ><p id='toggle-toggle-id-25' data-fake-id='#toggle-id-25' class='toggler  av-title-above '  itemprop="headline"  role='tab' tabindex='0' aria-controls='toggle-id-25' data-slide-speed="200" data-title="Can we still reach a taxi company at night to pick us up in Hülben?" data-title-open="" data-aria_collapsed="Click to expand: Can we still reach a taxi company at night to pick us up in Hülben?" data-aria_expanded="Click to collapse: Can we still reach a taxi company at night to pick us up in Hülben?">Can we still reach a taxi company at night to pick us up in Hülben?<span class="toggle_icon"><span class="vert_icon"></span><span class="hor_icon"></span></span></p><div id='toggle-id-25' aria-labelledby='toggle-toggle-id-25' role='region' class='toggle_wrap  av-title-above'  ><div class='toggle_content invers-color '  itemprop="text" ><p class="p1">We definitely can’t guarantee that. For this reason, we strongly recommend making arrangements with a taxi company in advance. Tried-and-tested options include the shuttle service from “Bussle” (<span class="s1">www.sbussle.de</span>), F.A.M Sicherheit UG (<span class="s1">info@fam-sicherheit.de</span>), and Benni Wenner (<span class="s1">www.fahrservice-wenner.de</span>).</p>
</div></div></div></section>
<section class='av_toggle_section av-38za53-1-cbb6b8eb7aaa39c069bdd9ff25c25ae3'  itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/CreativeWork" ><div role="tablist" class="single_toggle" data-tags="{Alle} {besichtigung} {location} {termin} "  ><p id='toggle-toggle-id-26' data-fake-id='#toggle-id-26' class='toggler  av-title-above '  itemprop="headline"  role='tab' tabindex='0' aria-controls='toggle-id-26' data-slide-speed="200" data-title="Do you have more info about the adjacent RV park?" data-title-open="" data-aria_collapsed="Click to expand: Do you have more info about the adjacent RV park?" data-aria_expanded="Click to collapse: Do you have more info about the adjacent RV park?">Do you have more info about the adjacent RV park?<span class="toggle_icon"><span class="vert_icon"></span><span class="hor_icon"></span></span></p><div id='toggle-id-26' aria-labelledby='toggle-toggle-id-26' role='region' class='toggle_wrap  av-title-above'  ><div class='toggle_content invers-color '  itemprop="text" ><p class="p1">You can park your RV at the RV park (Wohnmobilhafen) free of charge. More information about the <span class="s1">RV park can be found here: </span>https://www.huelben.de/wohnmobilhafen/.</p>
</div></div></div></section>
</div></div>
<div  class='flex_column av-a948n-de8378ca9a67bc648dc3830c521dfeb2 av_one_half  avia-builder-el-16  el_after_av_one_half  el_before_av_section  avia-builder-el-last  flex_column_div  column-top-margin'     ><section  class='av_textblock_section av-2cw8cn-a9ce43f08aa49096ca1c9ad256129fa0 '   itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/CreativeWork" ><div class='avia_textblock'  itemprop="text" ><h2>Equipment &#038; Technology</h2>
</div></section>
<div  class='togglecontainer av-m67xxji7-426a31692ca8a8cdc8d655bd4ee5f860 av-minimal-toggle  avia-builder-el-18  el_after_av_textblock  avia-builder-el-last  toggle_close_all' >
<section class='av_toggle_section av-m67xx1lm-d375c96dacc4eb74925fa9e860a3ceb3'  itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/CreativeWork" ><div role="tablist" class="single_toggle" data-tags="{Alle} {ausstattung} {tische} {stühle} {technik} "  ><p id='toggle-toggle-id-27' data-fake-id='#toggle-id-27' class='toggler  av-title-above '  itemprop="headline"  role='tab' tabindex='0' aria-controls='toggle-id-27' data-slide-speed="200" data-title="What equipment is available on site?" data-title-open="" data-aria_collapsed="Click to expand: What equipment is available on site?" data-aria_expanded="Click to collapse: What equipment is available on site?">What equipment is available on site?<span class="toggle_icon"><span class="vert_icon"></span><span class="hor_icon"></span></span></p><div id='toggle-id-27' aria-labelledby='toggle-toggle-id-27' role='region' class='toggle_wrap  av-title-above'  ><div class='toggle_content invers-color '  itemprop="text" ><p>Waldgeflüster awaits you with everything you need for your special day. In addition to stylish basic furnishings with tables, chairs, and benches, we also offer state-of-the-art multimedia technology: a projector, sound system, and lighting, as well as portable speakers with microphones – everything to showcase your celebration perfectly. We’re happy to share all the details on request and are here for whatever you have in mind.</p>
</div></div></div></section>
<section class='av_toggle_section av-m67xxbyk-030f0fb32c48920fa6155417755dd661'  itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/CreativeWork" ><div role="tablist" class="single_toggle" data-tags="{Alle} {tanzfläche} {zelt} {feier} "  ><p id='toggle-toggle-id-28' data-fake-id='#toggle-id-28' class='toggler  av-title-above '  itemprop="headline"  role='tab' tabindex='0' aria-controls='toggle-id-28' data-slide-speed="200" data-title="Is a projector available?" data-title-open="" data-aria_collapsed="Click to expand: Is a projector available?" data-aria_expanded="Click to collapse: Is a projector available?">Is a projector available?<span class="toggle_icon"><span class="vert_icon"></span><span class="hor_icon"></span></span></p><div id='toggle-id-28' aria-labelledby='toggle-toggle-id-28' role='region' class='toggle_wrap  av-title-above'  ><div class='toggle_content invers-color '  itemprop="text" ><p class="p1">A professional projector that delivers a great picture even when it’s not completely dark can be set up in the marquee with a separate sound system. Our portable speaker incl. microphones can then be used in parallel. To connect picture + sound, all you need is your laptop with an HDMI port. A projection screen is also available.</p>
</div></div></div></section>
<section class='av_toggle_section av-m67xxbyk-12-ef4132ac0b52ccf0cc63477044e7be67'  itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/CreativeWork" ><div role="tablist" class="single_toggle" data-tags="{Alle} {tanzfläche} {zelt} {feier} "  ><p id='toggle-toggle-id-29' data-fake-id='#toggle-id-29' class='toggler  av-title-above '  itemprop="headline"  role='tab' tabindex='0' aria-controls='toggle-id-29' data-slide-speed="200" data-title="Can the DJ bring their own equipment?" data-title-open="" data-aria_collapsed="Click to expand: Can the DJ bring their own equipment?" data-aria_expanded="Click to collapse: Can the DJ bring their own equipment?">Can the DJ bring their own equipment?<span class="toggle_icon"><span class="vert_icon"></span><span class="hor_icon"></span></span></p><div id='toggle-id-29' aria-labelledby='toggle-toggle-id-29' role='region' class='toggle_wrap  av-title-above'  ><div class='toggle_content invers-color '  itemprop="text" ><p class="p1">Of course, your DJ can also bring their own (complete) sound and lighting equipment. In your own interest, please make sure it doesn’t take up too much space on the dance floor.</p>
</div></div></div></section>
<section class='av_toggle_section av-m67xx6hi-50cd63ef31a6c548043c51cfb04205de'  itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/CreativeWork" ><div role="tablist" class="single_toggle" data-tags="{Alle} {wlan} {internet} {technik} "  ><p id='toggle-toggle-id-30' data-fake-id='#toggle-id-30' class='toggler  av-title-above '  itemprop="headline"  role='tab' tabindex='0' aria-controls='toggle-id-30' data-slide-speed="200" data-title="Is there Wi-Fi on site?" data-title-open="" data-aria_collapsed="Click to expand: Is there Wi-Fi on site?" data-aria_expanded="Click to collapse: Is there Wi-Fi on site?">Is there Wi-Fi on site?<span class="toggle_icon"><span class="vert_icon"></span><span class="hor_icon"></span></span></p><div id='toggle-id-30' aria-labelledby='toggle-toggle-id-30' role='region' class='toggle_wrap  av-title-above'  ><div class='toggle_content invers-color '  itemprop="text" ><p data-pm-slice="1 1 &#091;&#093;">Wi-Fi is generally available, though signal quality can fluctuate. For music, we recommend downloading it in advance.</p>
</div></div></div></section>
<section class='av_toggle_section av-m67xxbyk-11-8239974a6df8cb3e61245da1e34f4e65'  itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/CreativeWork" ><div role="tablist" class="single_toggle" data-tags="{Alle} {tanzfläche} {zelt} {feier} "  ><p id='toggle-toggle-id-31' data-fake-id='#toggle-id-31' class='toggler  av-title-above '  itemprop="headline"  role='tab' tabindex='0' aria-controls='toggle-id-31' data-slide-speed="200" data-title="Are there power outlets outdoors?" data-title-open="" data-aria_collapsed="Click to expand: Are there power outlets outdoors?" data-aria_expanded="Click to collapse: Are there power outlets outdoors?">Are there power outlets outdoors?<span class="toggle_icon"><span class="vert_icon"></span><span class="hor_icon"></span></span></p><div id='toggle-id-31' aria-labelledby='toggle-toggle-id-31' role='region' class='toggle_wrap  av-title-above'  ><div class='toggle_content invers-color '  itemprop="text" ><p class="p1">Powering a band/singer/etc. is no problem here: we have outlets all over the outdoor areas &#8211; at the open-air wedding ceremony spot, seating nook, outdoor bar, marquee, and terrace. There are also plenty of three-phase power connections for the caterer.</p>
</div></div></div></section>
<section class='av_toggle_section av-m67xxbyk-10-35a74d059e14b9571ab1668d85c5437d'  itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/CreativeWork" ><div role="tablist" class="single_toggle" data-tags="{Alle} {tanzfläche} {zelt} {feier} "  ><p id='toggle-toggle-id-32' data-fake-id='#toggle-id-32' class='toggler  av-title-above '  itemprop="headline"  role='tab' tabindex='0' aria-controls='toggle-id-32' data-slide-speed="200" data-title="Is there a dance floor?" data-title-open="" data-aria_collapsed="Click to expand: Is there a dance floor?" data-aria_expanded="Click to collapse: Is there a dance floor?">Is there a dance floor?<span class="toggle_icon"><span class="vert_icon"></span><span class="hor_icon"></span></span></p><div id='toggle-id-32' aria-labelledby='toggle-toggle-id-32' role='region' class='toggle_wrap  av-title-above'  ><div class='toggle_content invers-color '  itemprop="text" ><p>Our indoor dance floor offers a real club feel – right next to the bar, so your guests are always in the middle of the action.</p>
</div></div></div></section>
<section class='av_toggle_section av-m67xxbyk-9-74d6b319c34d4d622c2fbf4ec094e936'  itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/CreativeWork" ><div role="tablist" class="single_toggle" data-tags="{Alle} {tanzfläche} {zelt} {feier} "  ><p id='toggle-toggle-id-33' data-fake-id='#toggle-id-33' class='toggler  av-title-above '  itemprop="headline"  role='tab' tabindex='0' aria-controls='toggle-id-33' data-slide-speed="200" data-title="What exactly is the getting-ready cabin?" data-title-open="" data-aria_collapsed="Click to expand: What exactly is the getting-ready cabin?" data-aria_expanded="Click to collapse: What exactly is the getting-ready cabin?">What exactly is the getting-ready cabin?<span class="toggle_icon"><span class="vert_icon"></span><span class="hor_icon"></span></span></p><div id='toggle-id-33' aria-labelledby='toggle-toggle-id-33' role='region' class='toggle_wrap  av-title-above'  ><div class='toggle_content invers-color '  itemprop="text" ><p class="p1">Our additional getting-ready cabin can be used for the couple’s styling and is designed exactly for that. Retro sofa, full-length mirror, vanity table, ring light, Bluetooth speaker, opaque curtains…everything is there to spend fun hours getting styled with your bridal party/stylists.</p>
<p>More ideas for using it after/instead of styling:</p>
<p class="p1">Kids’ playhouse: You can also use the cabin as a kids’ playhouse. We’ve placed the furniture along the edges to create a play/crawling area in the middle of the cabin. It’s also super convenient for nursing on the sofa or putting the little ones to sleep in the evening.</p>
<p class="p1">Photo booth: The boho ambiance with the retro sofa also makes a great photo backdrop, and of course you can set up your photo booth here as well.</p>
<p class="p1">PS: The cabin is insulated all around, protecting against heat/cold/noise.</p>
<p class="p1">If you’re interested in using it, please let us know (e.g., during the final planning meeting).</p>
</div></div></div></section>
<section class='av_toggle_section av-m67xxbyk-8-be09e71b7735db34eb335f95da34cbed'  itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/CreativeWork" ><div role="tablist" class="single_toggle" data-tags="{Alle} {tanzfläche} {zelt} {feier} "  ><p id='toggle-toggle-id-34' data-fake-id='#toggle-id-34' class='toggler  av-title-above '  itemprop="headline"  role='tab' tabindex='0' aria-controls='toggle-id-34' data-slide-speed="200" data-title="Is there a changing table?" data-title-open="" data-aria_collapsed="Click to expand: Is there a changing table?" data-aria_expanded="Click to collapse: Is there a changing table?">Is there a changing table?<span class="toggle_icon"><span class="vert_icon"></span><span class="hor_icon"></span></span></p><div id='toggle-id-34' aria-labelledby='toggle-toggle-id-34' role='region' class='toggle_wrap  av-title-above'  ><div class='toggle_content invers-color '  itemprop="text" ><p class="p1">A professional changing table for your baby guests is installed in the women’s restroom.</p>
</div></div></div></section>
