</div></div></div></section>
<section class='av_toggle_section av-m67xxbyk-6-e96f7faccce6fb30343b7e9280b7c1ac'  itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/CreativeWork" ><div role="tablist" class="single_toggle" data-tags="{Alle} {tanzfläche} {zelt} {feier} "  ><p id='toggle-toggle-id-36' data-fake-id='#toggle-id-36' class='toggler  av-title-above '  itemprop="headline"  role='tab' tabindex='0' aria-controls='toggle-id-36' data-slide-speed="200" data-title="Do you have glasses / coffee cups?" data-title-open="" data-aria_collapsed="Click to expand: Do you have glasses / coffee cups?" data-aria_expanded="Click to collapse: Do you have glasses / coffee cups?">Do you have glasses / coffee cups?<span class="toggle_icon"><span class="vert_icon"></span><span class="hor_icon"></span></span></p><div id='toggle-id-36' aria-labelledby='toggle-toggle-id-36' role='region' class='toggle_wrap  av-title-above'  ><div class='toggle_content invers-color '  itemprop="text" ><p class="p1">We have everything on site for the beverage service we provide – you don’t need to worry about a thing. Glasses for all drinks and cups + teaspoons for coffee/tea are on site.</p>
